# Whole Cost hard rules

Single engine: `src/lib/inventory/whole-cost-rules.ts` (wired into price calculator DM cost, Top Vendor Models, sales CSV row margin when a rule matches, `scripts/fill-whole-cost.ts`). Prefer sheet/calculator cost over CSV Profit Amount whenever a rule hits.

## Always (every surface, all historical sales)

1. **Fixed SKU costs** (everyone) — see `FIXED_WHOLE_COST_BY_SKU` (231611→350, …). Match by leading Item # digits (`231618S` → `231618`).
1b. **SKU divisor overrides** — see `SKU_DIVISOR_OVERRIDE` (e.g. `240304` → base ÷ 8.8). Beats design/dept formulas (including GOLD JEWL ÷4).
1c. **Priority collections** (beat LADYS RING, GENTS RING, gold ÷4, and diamond-dept ÷8.8). Match design **or** description unless noted. Check Bella Ovani before generic Ovani.
   - **Bella Ovani** (design `BELLA OVANI` / `BELLA OVAN`, or description) → **base ÷ 2.25**
   - **Aanika V** / Anika V (design or description) → **base ÷ 2.25**
   - **Ovani** (design or description, including Ladies Ring and Ovani Gent / Ovanifusio) → **base ÷ 2.25**
   - **Novello** (design or description) → **base ÷ 8.8**
   - **Quince** / Quience (design or description) → **base ÷ 2.25**
   - **Eternal Vow** (design, description, or Class `ETERNAL-VOW`) → **base ÷ 2.25**
   - **Benchmark** (description only) → **base ÷ 2.25**
1d. **Department `GENTS RING`** → **base ÷ 8.8** when no priority collection matched (beats GOLD JEWL ÷4).
2. **UV gold** — gold jewelry (Design `GOLD JEWL` / `GOLD JEWEL` / `GOLD BANDS` **or** gold dept incl. `GOLD CHAIN`, `GOLD ID`, …) + UV signal (Design `UV`, Class `UV`, or description `UV` / `ultimate value`) → **base ÷ 1.3**
3. **Diamond** (diamond department **or** “diamond” in description) + UV / ultimate value in description → **base ÷ 8.8**  
   - Except the fixed special SKUs and priority collections above
4. **Triton** → **base ÷ 2.25**. **Tungsten** (`TUNGS BAND` or tungsten in description) → **cost = base** (tag on calculator, Sales Amount on the dashboard). **Rolex** and **Cartier** → **base ÷ 2.10**.

## Cost base (important)

| Surface | Base for CP divisor rules |
|---|---|
| **Price calculator / onhand / DM cost** | **Tag Price** |
| **Sales dashboard / Top Vendor Models / daily sales report / parse margins** | **Sales Amount** (gross, not Total/net) |

Daily uploads and the sales dashboard (including Jul 1 → Aug 11 seed window and forward) must use Sales Amount × rules, then profit = Net − signed (unit cost × |qty|) **after** merging split salesperson rows of the same Transaction # + SKU. Keep return / cancel-leg rules in `top-models-wholesale-margin.ts` (`collapseSplitTxnSkuRows`, `signedWholesaleUnitCost`, `collapseCancelledSkuLegs`).

Do not invent other gold÷1.3 triggers (e.g. gold department alone without a UV signal). Plain GOLD JEWL / GOLD CHAIN without UV → ÷ 4 (sheet). Class `10KT` alone is **not** a UV signal — only Design `UV`, Class `UV`, or UV/ultimate value in description.

When changing these rules, update `whole-cost-rules.ts`, `public/CP_Divisor_Rules.csv`, and `tests/inventory/pricing-rules.test.ts`.
